    {
      "id": "6SewBRMyCBqMirQJn_VHJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2612.0695096955437,
      "y": 212.77459963356145,
      "width": 481.43963623046875,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2096216816,
      "version": 504,
      "versionNonce": 171832863,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793529517488,
      "created": 1792933076670,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Message\n- chatId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp + id] (SK)\n- id\n- timestamp\n- senderId\n- content\n- attachmentLink\n- TTL\n...\n\nInbox\n- clientId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp] (SK)\n- chatId\n- msgId\n- TTL\n...\n\n// or (avoid querying message again when fanout)\nInbox (store all the msg info)\n- clientId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp] (SK)\n- chatId, senderId, content, attachmentIds, ts\n...\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Message\n- chatId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp + id] (SK)\n- id\n- timestamp\n- senderId\n- content\n- attachmentLink\n- TTL\n...\n\nInbox\n- clientId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp] (SK)\n- chatId\n- msgId\n- TTL\n...\n\n// or (avoid querying message again when fanout)\nInbox (store all the msg info)\n- clientId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp] (SK)\n- chatId, senderId, content, attachmentIds, ts\n...\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4UcPSLPdNIld7_AXDUEEK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 962.6197870814997,
      "y": 558.9381882936152,
      "width": 1236.934532862719,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1976794640,
      "version": 728,
      "versionNonce": 962281297,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793529517488,
      "created": 1792934086872,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Main process: WS receive msg -> write to Message -> query Member's GSI to get all userIds -> (query each user's clientIds) ->\nwrite to each user's inbox -> ack send -> realtime send by WS for online, keep for offline -> ack recv -> delete inbox (msg\nexpires by TTL, no per-ack delete: group needs all 100 acks)\n    - sender retry: no ack in N s -> resend with same clientMsgId, server dedup (idempotent)\n    - crash after Message written, before Inbox fanout -> sender gets no ack -> retry covers it",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Main process: WS receive msg -> write to Message -> query Member's GSI to get all userIds -> (query each user's clientIds) ->\nwrite to each user's inbox -> ack send -> realtime send by WS for online, keep for offline -> ack recv -> delete inbox (msg expires by TTL, no per-ack delete: group needs all 100 acks)\n    - sender retry: no ack in N s -> resend with same clientMsgId, server dedup (idempotent)\n    - crash after Message written, before Inbox fanout -> sender gets no ack -> retry covers it",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r1iOzVzMPBCn-WNs_Co6d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 957.3153181506221,
      "y": 726.8792703290334,
      "width": 1326.6000000000001,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1080170512,
      "version": 903,
      "versionNonce": 209181247,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793529517488,
      "created": 1792934596007,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive 1: how to scale to support 1B users?\n- estimate: 1B users, ~20% online -> 200M concurrent ws; 100K~1M conn/host -> 200~2000 Realtime hosts; 100B msg/day -> ~1M\nmsg/s\n- Chat Realtime Service from single host to cluster\n- How to route msg between cluster? -> Redis pub/sub, Kafka, consistent hash\n    - Kafka: topic per user impossible, consumer group rebalance slow (built for throughput, not ms-level point-to-point push)\n    - consistent hash: unstable when changing, hard to maintain (need registry + direct RPC between hosts)\n    - Redis pub/sub: cheap and quick (at most once, but could be covered by Message/Inbox)\n        - channel per userId (clientId), subscribe on connect, unsubscribe on disconnect\n        - ~1M publish/s -> Redis Cluster sharded pub/sub, shard by userId\n        - online user misses a dropped publish -> host sweeps Inbox for its connected users every ~30s (or heartbeat carries last seq)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive 1: how to scale to support 1B users?\n- estimate: 1B users, ~20% online -> 200M concurrent ws; 100K~1M conn/host -> 200~2000 Realtime hosts; 100B msg/day -> ~1M msg/s\n- Chat Realtime Service from single host to cluster\n- How to route msg between cluster? -> Redis pub/sub, Kafka, consistent hash\n    - Kafka: topic per user impossible, consumer group rebalance slow (built for throughput, not ms-level point-to-point push)\n    - consistent hash: unstable when changing, hard to maintain (need registry + direct RPC between hosts)\n    - Redis pub/sub: cheap and quick (at most once, but could be covered by Message/Inbox)\n        - channel per userId (clientId), subscribe on connect, unsubscribe on disconnect\n        - ~1M publish/s -> Redis Cluster sharded pub/sub, shard by userId\n        - online user misses a dropped publish -> host sweeps Inbox for its connected users every ~30s (or heartbeat carries last seq)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
