      "updated": 1793587495082,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aggregator: one min-heap (size K) per window\n- newCount <- RETURNING views\n- in heap -> update; > heap top -> replace; else skip\n- tumbling: only increments -> exact\n- window closes -> freeze & publish, start a new heap",
      "originalText": "Aggregator: one min-heap (size K) per window\n- newCount <- RETURNING views\n- in heap -> update; > heap top -> replace; else skip\n- tumbling: only increments -> exact\n- window closes -> freeze & publish, start a new heap",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
